            "columns_description" :
              [
                "The name of the subway station or of multiple subway stations within one station complex, separated by a semi-colon. For stations that are not in complexes, this is identical to the stop name.",
                "TRUE if this is a station complex, and FALSE if not.",
                "The name of the subway station, with the services that serve the station during weekday daytime hours in parenthesis.",
                "The subway routes that serve the station during weekdays.",
                "Notes on the direction a station is accessible in if it is only accessible in one direction or for a particular platform.",
                "The borough the station is in. Bx for Bronx, B for Brooklyn, M for Manhattan, Q for Queens, SI for Staten Island. ",
                "This indicates whether or not a station is in Manhattan’s Central Business District (CBD). This value is either TRUE or FALSE.",
                "The Complex ID, or its Complex Master Reference Number.",
                "0 if the station is not ADA-accessible, 1 if the station is fully accessible, 2 if the station is partially accessible.",
                "The type of structure the subway station is located on or in (At Grade, Elevated, Embankment, Open Cut, Subway, Viaduct, etc.). If it is a station complex, and the component stations have different structure types, both are noted, separated by a semi-colon.",
                "The number of stations within a station complex or 1 if the station is not a station complex.",
                "The ID, or Master Reference Number, for the station. If it is a station complex, multiple IDs are shown, separated by a semi-colon.",
                "The latitude for the centroid of the station complex.",
                "The longitude for the centroid of the station complex.",
                "The GTFS Stop ID or IDs for the station. If it is a station complex, multiple IDs are shown, separated by a semi-colon. ",
                "The name of the subway station."
              ],
